  "final_text": "The bug was in how 12-hour times are parsed. `parse_12h` in `activity/timeparse.py` read \"12:xx AM\" as noon (hour 12) when it should be just after midnight (hour 0). That made the 12:10 AM and 12:20 AM events land in the middle of the day, so the session that crosses midnight split in two.\n\nI added the missing case: when the time is AM and the hour is 12, the hour becomes 0. All 7 tests now pass, including `test_session_across_midnight`."
